{title: Tich Button}
{artist: Kulwinder Billa}
{key: Dm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Dm] Main ajj ton hoya [C] haan [Dm] tera,        [A#] Kann sun?na chaunde [C] naa [Dm] tera
[Dm] Mainu supne aunde [C] ne,        Ni main [A#] chadheya phirda ghodi
Teri [Dm] meri adiye [Am] ni,        Laggu [A#] tich button?an di jodi
Teri [Dm] meri adiye [C] ni,        Laggu [A#] tich button?an di jodi
[Dm] Teri meri..        [Dm] Mainu sonh ae teri [C] ni
[C] Kade na bhullunga mukh [Dm] tera,        [Dm] Tu mehandi naa likh [C] li
Sohniye [A#] naa veeni te [Dm] mera,        [Dm] Chaahdi da kujh vi [Am] nai
Bas tu [A#] dil mera na todi,        [Dm] Teri meri adiye [C] ni
Laggu [A#] tich button?an di jodi,        [Dm] Teri meri adiye [C] ni
[Dm] Beh katheyan paavan [C] ge,        [C] Hundiyan ishq diyan jo [Dm] baatan
[Dm] Pher hans ke langan [C] giyan,        Sohniye [A#] lammiyan lammiyan [Dm] raatan
[Dm] Phir lammiyan lammiyan raatan,        [Dm] Gham le rakhdi [Am] gayi
Tainu [A#] hasse jau [Dm] mori,        Teri [Dm] meri adiye [Am] ni
Laggu [A#] tich button?an di jodi
